				3
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Cocoon, Mountain, and Output submodules\n\nRoutine submodule synchronization bringing in latest changes across the application stack:\n\n1. Mountain (2d330dbf): Refactor to clean up verbose development naming (binary/lib/tauri config renamed from `DevelopmentNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency_22NodeVersion_Bundle_Clean_Debug_ElectronProfile_Mountain` to `Mountain`). Complete stub implementations for OutputProvider::CloseChannel and WorkspaceProvider::OpenFile. Remove obsolete .Backup files.\n\n2. Cocoon (ce5630dc): Submodule sync to latest extension host changes.\n\n3. Output (36dbc44e): Submodule sync to latest bundled artifacts from Rest.\n\nImpact: Mountain's IPC wiring for output channel management and document opening is now complete. Extension host and bundled JS artifacts are updated to latest.",
			"SHA": "7ba0ebefcaad71bc4f1ba3315bd281a4e0b8f619"
